# Optional developer-local Compose override. `compose.yaml` alone is a complete
# standard environment; this file only ever adds host-specific conveniences.
# Documented by the tracked `compose.override.yaml.example`, which nobody has to
# copy. Never create it automatically -- a fresh clone must start without it.
/compose.override.yaml

# Legacy name of the same thing, kept ignored so that an existing local copy
# does not suddenly show up as an untracked file. See the migration note in
# README.md; rename yours to `compose.override.yaml`.
/compose.custom.yaml
.devcontainer/devcontainer.custom.yaml
